      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we also update the doc comment on `Target::starlark_deps()` in `src/gn/target.h` (lines 315–318)?\n\nIt currently says \"The only purpose of this field is to ensure that all of a target\u0027s starlark dependencies are resolved before itself\", but with this CL it now has a stronger invariant: `starlark_deps_` must preserve both the exact traversal order of `Attr::dependencies()` and duplicate entries (i.e., it must not be sorted or deduplicated), since `create_ctx_fields()` consumes it positionally. Documenting that invariant in `target.h` would help prevent accidental breakage in the future.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "02d999588230ea55f4f198e86d0ccaccc1e9381f",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
